 ## Background
-Originated in the context of differentiable volume rendering and neural radiance fields [S1, S2, S3]. [S1] introduces the translation, rotation, and AO regularization for Human Gaussian Splatting to ensure realistic body deformations [S1]. [S2] introduces Explicit Density Regularization for triplane-based neural field generation to mitigate floating artifacts [S2]. [S3] introduces Domain Regularization for neural prefiltering to handle voxel boundary precision issues [S3].
